:: Lucas Hang Out Park Playground Nasty Kids [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> are hanging out near the bottom of one of the slides. Mostly just chatting and goofing around, but occasionally one of you will climb up and slide down. <span style="color:LightGreen">It is wholesome in it’s simplicity and you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> share a laugh over a dumb joke</span> <span style="color:Yellow">when a blur flies through the air and impacts with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ leg.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
