                Cry: 1,
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Ouch!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> cringes, <span style="color:Yellow">gripping his leg as a small pebble tumbles to the ground next to him.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“That hurt. Where did that-?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> pauses as you both turn and see a pair of pair of kids, the same age of you, a few feet away. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Whoops, sorry!”</span> One of them laugh, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I was actually aiming for your face! Here, I’ll aim better this time!”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">He tosses another small rock, but thankfully <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> is able to dive behind the slide to dodge it.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Come on, I thought you were tough! Or is that just your mommy?”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">Both boys laugh mockingly as an upset <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> stares at the ground.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Come on, let’s go somewhere else.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> says, grabbing you by the hand, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“They’re just a bunch of bullies. Best thing to do is just ignore them.”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">You agree that may be the best option, but there is also a small part of you that wants to do something stupider but more satisfying.</span> <br>
<br>

