        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Fucking coward! I guess what they say about you is right!”</span> The laugh and mock <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>, continuing to throw rocks in your general direction. <span style="color:Yellow">You notice redness building in <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ eyes, but he manages to hold it together as you two walk well out of sight.</span> You ask him if he’s okay and what that was about. <br>

