            <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“They’re…”</span> He pauses, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“They’re friends of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ryker</span>, his new friends anyway. Just some punks who look for any excuse to mess with people. They’re been trying to goad me into fighting them, see if <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ryker</span>’s telling the truth about… well, yeah. I’d rather not get into it.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> forces a smile, trying not to seem too upset about all this. <span style="color:LightGreen">You smile back, suggesting a new game for the two of you to play to help take his mind of things.</span> <br>
