        <span style="color:LightCoral">Anger welling up, you pick up the muddiest rock you can find in the dirt below you and shout back at the boys, tossing the rock towards them with all your strength.</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">And unlike the boys, your aim is perfect as you nail one of them in the head! You freeze as the boy shouts out a curse, rubbing his head before they both glare at you angrily.</span> <br>

