        <span style="color:LightCoral">You feel rage building up inside you like a destructive storm. Your inner fire burns with a desire to release as the boys continue to mock and bully your friend with words and stones.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> tugs on your arm, whispering <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Come on, they’re not worth it.”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">But your anger cannot be contained.</span> <br>
        <br>
