        <br>
        <span style="color:Pink">This entire time, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> is watching with a bewildered expression, both scared and amazed that you developed such anger on his behalf.</span> Eventually, the boys manage to shove you off of them and take off running. <span style="color:LightGreen">Despite outnumbers and probably outpowering you, the sheer strength and suddenness of your rage caught them completely off guard. You begin to toss rocks in their fleeing direction shouting out until your anger is quelled by a hand grabbing yours.</span> <br>

