        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I think you scared them off.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> chuckles nervously. <span style="color:Pink">You turn back to him to see the boy standing with a shy smile and flushed cheeks.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Tha… thanks. It’s been a while since someone stood up for me like that. It’s…”</span> He chuckles nervously, rubbing the back of his head. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Come on, let’s get you some water. Your throat sounds a little scratchy from all that yelling.”</span> <br>
